w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W-tzIt_SfssQ7kNvwGsA5Zg&_nc_oc=AdkasA2-Ngu7LVwIHW-uBcWMnnSf1XfyAoePLCSXOcIrGq5DW3QbgUicrQTVI9WmNnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwaeyu3c0Q-TCjqNdfIGEX9dM_mUPnIPCIvAqOXendWgA&oe=69BD362A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ySjDfM4hnnsQ7kNvwHzatRh&_nc_oc=AdmslnM9HzymE7_nBG2U8KzfYbZul2sMaS06b7hTHKLSB2EUK--3iunhk65pJo_E6e0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyyDHDoscWcPoF2jwiy2sg0u5P3RvCuy81TMw6l5zEYTw&oe=69BD48DE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qTAE8fitbA8Q7kNvwGQJElc&_nc_oc=Adkk44S9gVbXNG7FgiW_iYFbQyJkH--8If6UNJ-75j3GgfHOHf5vnRdjZi9zjki4DDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyZcERa3rS4_-QKRzcycRnyTMe9Dfh5cNgCdx9KNY3loA&oe=69BD37B1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9